  "about": "How a reply is read into blocks, the same on the web page (mdBlocks in public/app.js, test/markdown-web.test.js) and in the Android app (parseBlocks in Markdown.kt, MarkdownTest.kt). Each case is a source text and the flat list of blocks it becomes: heading (level, text), para (text), item (text, number or null, depth), quote (text), rule, code (text), table (rows). A rule changes here and in both apps together.",
