  "streamAbout": "A reply draft as it is drawn while it still grows (docs/api.md, \"The reply draft\"): each case is a draft and the blocks of what is drawn of it, the same on the web page (draftSource, then mdBlocks, in public/app.js) and in the Android app (draftSource, then parseBlocks, in Markdown.kt). A whole draft is drawn as the reply is.",
